    {
      "source": "Argument resolver to extract a <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> object from a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/context/request/NativeWebRequest.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.context.request\"><code>NativeWebRequest</code></a> for a particular\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>MethodParameter</code></a>. A <a href=\"PageableArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>PageableArgumentResolver</code></a> can either resolve <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> itself or wrap\nanother <a href=\"PageableArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>PageableArgumentResolver</code></a> to post-process <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a>.",
      "translation": "用于从特定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.core\"><code>MethodParameter</code></a>的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/context/request/NativeWebRequest.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.web.context.request\"><code>NativeWebRequest</code></a>中提取<a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Pageable</code></a>对象的参数解析器。<a href=\"PageableArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.web 中的接口\"><code>PageableArgumentResolver</code></a>可以解析<a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Pageable</code></a>本身，也可以包装另一个<a href=\"PageableArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.web 中的接口\"><code>PageableArgumentResolver</code></a>以进行后处理。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
